abstract: >-
  GENOVA Studio is a native Apple Silicon macOS interface for supported
  generalizability-theory workflows. Its balanced pathway incorporates the
  jGENOVA statistical core developed by Joe E. Crick and Robert L. Brennan;
  that contribution is credited here without assigning the jGENOVA code a new
  license. The BSD 3-Clause license applies only to original GENOVA Studio
  code and materials; the unchanged jGENOVA component is excluded and is
  documented separately in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. GENOVA Studio also contains
  separately implemented, bounded unbalanced and multivariate pilot pathways.
